                "title": "Diamond Crystal Knob with Lancaster Rose",
                "description": "The dynamic shape of Emtek's Clear Crystal Diamond Knob is enhanced by the ornate Lancaster Rose, making this knobset a sparkling reminder of a time past. The Diamond Crystal Knob with Lancaster Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This Ornate Clear Crystal Diamond with Lancaster Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of traditional finishes.\r\n",
